{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17100","headline":"奉酬中书相公至日圜丘行事合於中书宿直移止於集贤院叙情见寄之什 · 崔备","name":"奉酬中书相公至日圜丘行事合於中书宿直移止於集贤院叙情见寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"典籍开书府，恩荣避鼎司。\n郊丘资有事，斋戒守无爲。\n宿雾蒙琼树，余香覆玉墀。\n进经逢乙夜，展礼值明时。\n勳共山河列，名同竹帛垂。\n年年佐尧舜，相与致雍熙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}